# OLESKO inner page structure (locked)

Do not invent a parallel shell. Collection has already been rebuilt without this twice.

## Inner page shell

```
page_wrap + u-theme-dark
  Global Styles
  Global Guides
  OLESKO Global Header
  page_main#main
    olesko_page_section + u-section + u-theme-dark  (#page)
      section_contain + u-container
        olesko_section_grid + u-grid-custom
          intro and/or content
  OLESKO Global Footer
```

`section_contain` + `u-container` is required. Never put `olesko_section_grid` as a direct child of the section.

## Intro band

Copy uses `olesko_section_intro` + `u-grid-subgrid` + `u-column-start-3` + `u-column-span-8`.

## Content

- Collection cards: `home_service_film_card` + `u-grid-stack` + `u-column-span-6`; odd `u-column-start-1`, even `u-column-start-7`. Wrap the still in a Div `home_service_film_media` (that class draws the play triangle). Then `home_service_film_image`, then copy. Whole card links to the film page. Do not nest another link inside the card.
- Film pages: intro in the 8-column band; Mux player + share stay inside `section_contain` + `u-container`. Class `olesko_film_embed`. Never `olesko_film_video`.
- Commission: forms in the same 8-column band unless Sebastian asks otherwise.

Canonical copy also lives in Webflow as `rules/olesko-page-structure.md`.
